  "why": "A contract can publish any topics. Here the third topic of a `[transfer, from, to]` event is the symbol `not_an_address`. A reader that converts the `to` topic into an address or muxed address must return an error and keep reading; one that panics, halts or books a transfer to some address is wrong. Nothing moves and only the source account changes.",
